4. ✅ Confirmed Analytics component is correctly imported and used in layout.tsx
5. ✅ Installed all dependencies with npm
6. ✅ Successfully built the project (`npm run build`)
7. ✅ Verified Analytics package is bundled in build output (.next/server/chunks/)

